# Oct 9 2026 rebuild. Netlify publishes the repository root, so the build sources, scripts, notes and
# keyword research would otherwise be public. Forced 404s keep them out of view. None of these paths
# is a page; the site itself lives in the folders and .html files listed in sitemap.xml.
/src/*            /404.html   404!
/scripts/*        /404.html   404!
/docs/*           /404.html   404!
/keywords/*       /404.html   404!
/netlify/*        /404.html   404!
/.github/*        /404.html   404!
/build.py         /404.html   404!
/CLAUDE.md        /404.html   404!
/INTAKE.md        /404.html   404!
/PLAYBOOK.md      /404.html   404!
/SERVICES.md      /404.html   404!
